\":\"Not the version you're looking for?\"},\"dramas20\":\"Show More Reviews\",\"dramas20WithCount\":\"Show More Reviews ({count})\",\"dramas21\":\"You've reached the end.\",\"new_recommend_title\":\"For You\",\"allplots\":{\"title\":\"Browse Short Drama Genres \u0026 Shows\"},\"tag\":{\"title\":\"{tagName} Short Dramas \u0026 Reels to Watch Online\"}},\"download\":{\"download01\":\"NetShort - Check out all the hottest short dramas here!\",\"download02\":\"Looking for something to watch during your daily commute,lunchbreak, or just to unwind after a long day? Look no further than our NetShort TV!\",\"download03\":\"From indie films to award-winning TV series, we've got something for everyone. And with new content added regularly. you'll always have something fresh to watch.\",\"download04\":\"Scan the QR code to download, or simply open the link in your phone's browser.\",\"download05\":\"Feel free to click to copy the link!\",\"download06\":\"Download NetShort App\",\"download07\":\"You need to download the app to watch this episode\",\"download08\":\"Download App\",\"title\":\"Download NetShort - The Best App for Short Videos\",\"description\":\"Download NetShort, the ultimate app for creating, watching, and sharing short videos. Explore trending content, connect with creators, and express yourself with ease. Get started now!\",\"keywords\":\"download, NetShort, short video app, NetShort download, video sharing, trending videos\",\"meta\":{\"title\":\"Download NetShort App – Watch Short Dramas Free | NetShort\",\"description\":\"Download the NetShort app for iOS and Android. Watch short dramas, micro dramas, and reels shorts in HD — offline downloads, daily updates, and Exclusive originals.\"},\"nav\":{\"ariaPrimary\":\"Primary\",\"home\":\"Home\",\"genres\":\"Genres\",\"hotSeries\":\"Hot Series\",\"blog\":\"Blog\",\"getTheApp\":\"Get the App\"},\"hero\":{\"eyebrow\":\"Official NetShort App\",\"h1\":\"Download NetShort\",\"lead\":\"Exclusive short drama video — all in HD. Bring trending reels and enjoy drama time on iOS and Android.\",\"ctaDownload\":\"Download for iOS \u0026 Android\",\"ctaWatch\":\"Watch now\",\"noteBefore\":\"Prefer the browser? Watch on\",\"noteOr\":\"or\",\"trustReviews\":\"4.7★ · 1M+ reviews\",\"trustDownloads\":\"100M+ downloads\",\"trustGrossing\":\"#4 top grossing · Entertainment\",\"floatDownloads\":\"100M+ Downloads\",\"floatRating\":\"4.7 · Rating\",\"floatReviews\":\"1M+ Genuine Reviews\",\"badgeExclusive\":\"NetShort Exclusive\",\"phoneTagBaby\":\"Vertical Reels \u0026 Shorts\",\"phoneTagWargod\":\"1080P HD · Short Drama\",\"visualAria\":\"NetShort app drama previews\",\"ratingAria\":\"App ratings\"},\"getApp\":{\"h2\":\"Get the app\",\"lead\":\"Scan the QR code on your phone, or open the store link below.\",\"panelAria\":\"App download\",\"qrAria\":\"QR code to download NetShort\",\"available\":\"Available on the App Store and Google Play — one link for iOS \u0026 Android.\",\"appStore\":\"App Store\",\"googlePlay\":\"Google Play\",\"copyLink\":\"Copy download link\",\"linkCopied\":\"Link copied\",\"copyFailed\":\"Copy failed\"},\"why\":{\"h2\":\"Why the NetShort app\",\"lead\":\"Built for vertical short dramas — faster playback, offline saves, Exclusive drops first, and multiple ways to earn coins to unlock paid episodes.\",\"items\":{\"0\":{\"h3\":\"Short dramas made for mobile\",\"html\":\"Binge \u003clink\u003eshort dramas\u003c/link\u003e and micro dramas in a vertical player designed for commute-length episodes.\"},\"1\":{\"h3\":\"Download \u0026 watch offline\",\"html\":\"Save episodes in the app when available — handy for flights, subway rides, and spotty Wi‑Fi.\"},\"2\":{\"h3\":\"NetShort Exclusive originals\",\"html\":\"Catch Exclusive titles across sweet romance, revenge, aristocratic drama, and underdog comebacks — plus trending \u003clink\u003egood web series\u003c/link\u003e as they drop.\"},\"3\":{\"h3\":\"1080p HD streaming\",\"html\":\"Stream crisp HD on supported titles (VIP where required) — clear picture on phone or tablet.\"},\"4\":{\"h3\":\"17 languages\",\"html\":\"Switch languages in-app for localized short dramas and short videos across major markets.\"},\"5\":{\"h3\":\"Daily new episodes\",\"html\":\"Fresh short series, mini dramas, and trending reels added regularly — watch new videos every day.\"}}},\"reviews\":{\"h2\":\"What viewers say\",\"lead\":\"Real feedback from Google Play and the App Store — people bingeing short dramas on NetShort.\",\"starsAria\":\"4.7 out of 5\",\"ratingMeta\":\"Google Play average · 1M+ ratings · Rated 12+\",\"statsAria\":\"App store highlights\",\"statDownloads\":\"Downloads\",\"statReviews\":\"Reviews\",\"statGrossing\":\"Top grossing · Entertainment\",\"statStreaming\":\"Exclusive short dramas · HD\",\"showMore\":\"Show more reviews (6)\",\"showFewer\":\"Show fewer reviews\",\"source\":\"Curated \u003cstrong\u003e12\u003c/strong\u003e reviews from the \u003cstrong\u003eApp Store\u003c/strong\u003e and \u003cstrong\u003eGoogle Play\u003c/strong\u003e (punctuation lightly cleaned). Highlights: 4.7★ · 100M+ downloads · #4 top grossing in Entertainment · Exclusive short dramas in HD.\"},\"faq\":{\"h2\":\"NetShort App FAQ\",\"lead\":\"Straight answers about downloading the app, free episodes, coins, ads, and offline watching.\",\"moreBefore\":\"Still stuck?\",\"moreFaq\":\"See the full NetShort FAQ\",\"moreOr\":\"or\",\"moreDownload\":\"download the app\",\"moreAfter\":\"and chat in-app.\",\"items\":{\"0\":{\"q\":\"What is the NetShort app?\",\"aText\":\"NetShort is a mobile app for short dramas and micro dramas — Exclusive originals plus licensed series, all in a vertical player. Think binge-friendly episodes for your commute, lunch break, or before bed. It's free to install on iOS and Android, with download links on this page.\",\"aHtml\":\"NetShort is a mobile app for \u003callPlots\u003eshort dramas\u003c/allPlots\u003e and micro dramas — Exclusive originals plus licensed series, all in a vertical player. Think binge-friendly episodes for your commute, lunch break, or before bed. It's free to install on iOS and Android, with \u003cstores\u003edownload links\u003c/stores\u003e on this page.\"},\"1\":{\"q\":\"Why download the app instead of watching on the website?\",\"aText\":\"You can watch series online in a browser anytime. The app is better when you want offline downloads, smoother vertical playback, push updates for new episodes, daily check-ins, and an easier way to manage your library on the go. Many viewers say it's more \\\"addictive\\\" for short breaks — in a good way.\",\"aHtml\":\"You can \u003clink\u003ewatch series online\u003c/link\u003e in a browser anytime. The app is better when you want offline downloads, smoother vertical playback, push updates for new episodes, daily check-ins, and an easier way to manage your library on the go. Many viewers say it's more \\\"addictive\\\" for short breaks — in a good way.\"},\"2\":{\"q\":\"Is NetShort free? How do ads and coins work?\",\"aText\":\"The app is free to download, and a lot of early episodes are free to start. To unlock more, you can watch ads, check in for coins/credits, or use VIP / in-app unlocks — so you can keep watching without always paying upfront. Availability depends on the title and your region; some episodes unlock faster with coins or membership.\",\"aHtml\":\"The app is free to download, and a lot of early episodes are free to start. To unlock more, you can watch ads, check in for coins/credits, or use VIP / in-app unlocks — so you can keep watching without always paying upfront. Availability depends on the title and your region; some episodes unlock faster with coins or membership.\"},\"3\":{\"q\":\"How do I unlock more episodes every day?\",\"aText\":\"Open the app and look for daily check-in, watch-ad rewards, and other coin tasks. Many users earn enough credits for a few episodes a day that way. If a title is locked, finish the reward flow or use coins — then hit play on the next episode.\",\"aHtml\":\"Open the app and look for daily check-in, watch-ad rewards, and other coin tasks. Many users earn enough credits for a few episodes a day that way. If a title is locked, finish the reward flow or use coins — then hit play on the next episode.\"},\"4\":{\"q\":\"Can I download episodes to watch offline?\",\"aText\":\"Yes — offline download is typically available in the NetShort app (not always on the website). Open a series, look for the download icon, and save episodes when your account and that title support it. Handy for flights and spotty Wi‑Fi.\",\"aHtml\":\"Yes — offline download is typically available in the \u003clink\u003eNetShort app\u003c/link\u003e (not always on the website). Open a series, look for the download icon, and save episodes when your account and that title support it. Handy for flights and spotty Wi‑Fi.\"},\"5\":{\"q\":\"Does the app support HD / 1080p?\",\"aText\":\"Yes. NetShort streams Exclusive short drama video in HD on supported titles — including crisp 1080p where available (VIP may be required for the highest quality). After you install, browse trending Hot Series and Exclusive originals.\",\"aHtml\":\"Yes. NetShort streams Exclusive short drama video in HD on supported titles — including crisp 1080p where available (VIP may be required for the highest quality). After you install, browse trending \u003clink\u003eHot Series\u003c/link\u003e and Exclusive originals.\"},\"6\":{\"q\":\"What kinds of short dramas can I watch?\",\"aText\":\"You'll find sweet romance, revenge, wealthy-family intrigue, underdog rise, fantasy, and more — plus NetShort Exclusive originals and daily new episodes. Start from Genres or Hot Series on the web, then continue in the app.\",\"aHtml\":\"You'll find sweet romance, revenge, wealthy-family intrigue, underdog rise, fantasy, and more — plus NetShort Exclusive originals and daily new episodes. Start from \u003callPlots\u003eGenres\u003c/allPlots\u003e or \u003chotseries\u003eHot Series\u003c/hotseries\u003e on the web, then continue in the app.\"},\"7\":{\"q\":\"How do I get help or send feedback?\",\"aText\":\"Fastest path: open the app → Profile → Feedback / customer service. Or email support@netshort.com with your NetShort ID, device, app version, and a short description of the issue. More answers live on our full FAQ.\",\"aHtml\":\"Fastest path: open the app → Profile → Feedback / customer service. Or email \u003csupport\u003esupport@netshort.com\u003c/support\u003e with your NetShort ID, device, app version, and a short description of the issue. More answers live on our \u003cfaq\u003efull FAQ\u003c/faq\u003e.\"}}},\"cta\":{\"h2\":\"Ready to binge?\",\"lead\":\"Install NetShort and start your next short drama in minutes.\",\"download\":\"Download the app\",\"seeAllPlots\":\"See All Plots\"}},\"blog\":{\"blog01\":\"Popular Blog\",\"blog02\":\"Refresh\",\"blog03\":\"Previous\",\"blog04\":\"Next\",\"blog05\":\"You May Like\",\"blog06\":{\"the\":\"Page \",\"page\":\"\"},\"default\":{\"title\":\"Company News, Drama Introduction, Drama Industry Knowledge - Netshort\",\"description\":\"The news channel mainly introduces the company's relevant news, drama introduction and industry knowledge. Welcome to learn about Netshort.\",\"keywords\":\"Company News, Drama Introduction, Drama Industry Knowledge, Netshort\"},\"series\":{\"title\":\" - Netshort\",\"the\":\"The\",\"description\":\" channel mainly introduces the company's \",\"learnMore\":\"Welcome to learn about Netshort.\",\"keywords\":\", Netshort\"},\"details\":{\"title\":\" - Netshort\"},\"recommend_title\":\"More Like This\"},\"common\":{\"common01\":\"Successful Replication\",\"common02\":\"Scan the QR code or click the app market icon to download the APP\",\"common03\":\"Play Now\",\"common04\":\"Open the NetShort APP to unlock more popular dramas \u0026 TV!\",\"common05\":\"Loading\",\"common06\":\"No More\",\"common07\":\"No result we found\",\"common08\":\"Continue Watching\",\"com