",\"shortPlayId\":\"2089654783947100161\",\"shortPlayName\":\"Billionaire Luna: Taming My Alpha Mates\",\"shortPlayNameNoHL\":\"Billionaire Luna: Taming My Alpha Mates\",\"shortPlayNameUrl\":\"/episode/billionaire-luna-taming-my-alpha-mates-2089654783947100161\",\"fullEpisodeNameUrl\":\"/full-episodes/billionaire-luna-taming-my-alpha-mates-2089654783947100161\",\"shortPlayCover\":\"https://awscover.netshort.com/tos-vod-mya-v-da59d5a2040f5f77/imageG/production/2089654781069807617/1787556961637-7679839805398369-3比4jpg~tplv-vod-rs:651:868.webp\",\"shotIntroduce\":\"A workaholic transmigrates as a disgraced imperial princess with sealed powers and a tragic fate. She activates a tenfold rebate system, unlocks supreme abilities and artifacts, tames four powerful orc partners, crushes vicious schemes, awakens SSS-grade bloodline, erases ancient grievances, and finally reigns as the benevolent queen.\",\"language\":\"en_US\",\"labelList\":[{\"labelId\":\"1983832091826315266\",\"labelName\":\"Time Travel\",\"labelNameUrl\":\"/drama/Time%20Travel-1983832091826315266\",\"language\":\"en\"},{\"labelId\":\"1983832091742429187\",\"labelName\":\"Life OL\",\"labelNameUrl\":\"/drama/Life%20OL-1983832091742429187\",\"language\":\"en\"},{\"labelId\":\"1983832092417712131\",\"labelName\":\"Fantasy Romance\",\"labelNameUrl\":\"/drama/Fantasy%20Romance-1983832092417712131\",\"language\":\"en\"}],\"totalEpisode\":60},{\"shortPlayLibraryId\":\"2092087423821373442\",\"shortPlayId\":\"2092087480910041090\",\"shortPlayName\":\"The Fool I Married Is a Billionaire\",\"shortPlayNameNoHL\":\"The Fool I Married Is a Billionaire\",\"shortPlayNameUrl\":\"/episode/the-fool-i-married-is-a-billionaire-2092087480910041090\",\"fullEpisodeNameUrl\":\"/full-episodes/the-fool-i-married-is-a-billionaire-2092087480910041090\",\"shortPlayCover\":\"https://awscover.netshort.com/tos-vod-mya-v-da59d5a2040f5f77/coverG/prod/939467709_3-4.jpg~tplv-vod-rs:651:868.webp\",\"shotIntroduce\":\"Bankrupt heiress Sienna impulsively marries Danny, a homeless \\\"fool,\\\" to save her family trust—unaware he is Damian, heir to the Sterling empire. His mind-reading secret protects her until the truth shatters their trust. A deadly kidnapping finally proves his love and reunites them.\",\"language\":\"en_US\",\"labelList\":[{\"labelId\":\"1983832091973115907\",\"labelName\":\"Wolf in Disguise\",\"labelNameUrl\":\"/drama/Wolf%20in%20Disguise-1983832091973115907\",\"language\":\"en\"},{\"labelId\":\"1983832091801149443\",\"labelName\":\"Second Chance\",\"labelNameUrl\":\"/drama/Second%20Chance-1983832091801149443\",\"language\":\"en\"},{\"labelId\":\"1983832091151032322\",\"labelName\":\"Sweet Romance\",\"labelNameUrl\":\"/drama/Sweet%20Romance-1983832091151032322\",\"language\":\"en\"}],\"totalEpisode\":13},{\"shortPlayLibraryId\":\"2092085481539850241\",\"shortPlayId\":\"2092085543393255427\",\"shortPlayName\":\"After Prison:I Sent My Ex-Wife to Hell\",\"shortPlayNameNoHL\":\"After Prison:I Sent My Ex-Wife to Hell\",\"shortPlayNameUrl\":\"/episode/after-prisoni-sent-my-ex-wife-to-hell-2092085543393255427\",\"fullEpisodeNameUrl\":\"/full-episodes/after-prisoni-sent-my-ex-wife-to-hell-2092085543393255427\",\"shortPlayCover\":\"https://awscover.netshort.com/tos-vod-mya-v-da59d5a2040f5f77/coverG/prod/942325470_3-4(5).jpg~tplv-vod-rs:651:868.webp\",\"shotIntroduce\":\"On a stormy Manhattan night, drunk‑driving Shayla causes a deadly crash. Arthur, a dedicated stay‑at‑home father who left his wealthy family two decades earlier, takes the blame, pressured by his kids and manipulated by Shayla.\\nIn prison, an attack on his life reveals the truth: Shayla and her lover Bella plan to kill him to grab his fortune. Staring at his torn‑up family photo, Arthur snaps out of denial and swears revenge on all the traitors.\",\"language\":\"en_US\",\"labelList\":[{\"labelId\":\"1983832036889935874\",\"labelName\":\"Urban Life\",\"labelNameUrl\":\"/drama/Urban%20Life-1983832036889935874\",\"language\":\"en\"},{\"labelId\":\"1983832036302733315\",\"labelName\":\"Revenge\",\"labelNameUrl\":\"/drama/Revenge-1983832036302733315\",\"language\":\"en\"},{\"labelId\":\"1983832036390813699\",\"labelName\":\"Feel-Good\",\"labelNameUrl\":\"/drama/Feel-Good-1983832036390813699\",\"language\":\"en\"}],\"totalEpisode\":15},{\"shortPlayLibraryId\":\"2091828448085368833\",\"shortPlayId\":\"2091828481165844481\",\"shortPlayName\":\"My Maid Stole My Heiress Identity\",\"shortPlayNameNoHL\":\"My Maid Stole My Heiress Identity\",\"shortPlayNameUrl\":\"/episode/my-maid-stole-my-heiress-identity-2091828481165844481\",\"fullEpisodeNameUrl\":\"/full-episodes/my-maid-stole-my-heiress-identity-2091828481165844481\",\"shortPlayCover\":\"https://awscover.netshort.com/tos-vod-mya-v-da59d5a2040f5f77/coverG/prod/942046589_3：4.png~tplv-vod-rs:651:868.webp\",\"shotIntroduce\":\"Ivy, the true heiress of House Black, enters Iliad Academy in disguise, only to find her maid Celia posing as her. As Celia steals her identity and humiliates her, Ivy quietly reveals her true power, exposes the impostor, and reclaims everything that belongs to her.\",\"language\":\"en_US\",\"labelList\":[{\"labelId\":\"1983832092468043778\",\"labelName\":\"Fantasy\",\"labelNameUrl\":\"/drama/Fantasy-1983832092468043778\",\"language\":\"en\"},{\"labelId\":\"1983832091792760834\",\"labelName\":\"Plot Twist\",\"labelNameUrl\":\"/drama/Plot%20Twist-1983832091792760834\",\"language\":\"en\"},{\"labelId\":\"1983832090941317123\",\"labelName\":\"Campus\",\"labelNameUrl\":\"/drama/Campus-1983832090941317123\",\"language\":\"en\"}],\"totalEpisode\":10},{\"shortPlayLibraryId\":\"2091801498314821633\",\"shortPlayId\":\"2091801979669929985\",\"shortPlayName\":\"After He Dumped Me, I Married a Fool—Who Turned Out to Be the Crown Prince\",\"shortPlayNameNoHL\":\"After He Dumped Me, I Married a Fool—Who Turned Out to Be the Crown Prince\",\"shortPlayNameUrl\":\"/episode/after-he-dumped-me-i-married-a-foolwho-turned-out-to-be-the-crown-prince-2091801979669929985\",\"fullEpisodeNameUrl\":\"/full-episodes/after-he-dumped-me-i-married-a-foolwho-turned-out-to-be-the-crown-prince-2091801979669929985\",\"shortPlayCover\":\"https://awscover.netshort.com/tos-vod-mya-v-da59d5a2040f5f77/coverG/prod/941944318_剧名（有标）.jpg~tplv-vod-rs:651:868.webp\",\"shotIntroduce\":\"After being dumped, Sylvia marries a beggar. To her surprise, the \\\"fool\\\" is actually the Crown Prince investigating in secret.He uses his mind-reading power to protect his wife like a boss. Together, they crush a rebellion, cross the huge class gap, and get married happily ever after.\",\"language\":\"en_US\",\"labelList\":[{\"labelId\":\"1983832092082167810\",\"labelName\":\"Multiple Identities\",\"labelNameUrl\":\"/drama/Multiple%20Identities-1983832092082167810\",\"language\":\"en\"},{\"labelId\":\"1983832092270911490\",\"labelName\":\"Revenge\",\"labelNameUrl\":\"/drama/Revenge-1983832092270911490\",\"language\":\"en\"},{\"labelId\":\"1983832091901812738\",\"labelName\":\"Karma\",\"labelNameUrl\":\"/drama/Karma-1983832091901812738\",\"language\":\"en\"}],\"totalEpisode\":15},{\"shortPlayLibraryId\":\"2091806566988599297\",\"shortPlayId\":\"2091806593857310722\",\"shortPlayName\":\"My Forbidden Love with an Octopus\",\"shortPlayNameNoHL\":\"My Forbidden Love with an Octopus\",\"shortPlayNameUrl\":\"/episode/my-forbidden-love-with-an-octopus-2091806593857310722\",\"fullEpisodeNameUrl\":\"/full-episodes/my-forbidden-love-with-an-octopus-2091806593857310722\",\"shortPlayCover\":\"https://awscover.netshort.com/tos-vod-mya-v-da59d5a2040f5f77/coverG/prod/941785078_海报（定）.jpg~tplv-vod-rs:651:868.webp\",\"shotIntroduce\":\"Abused fisher‑girl Eileen is trapped by her cruel husband Jack. He captures the ancient sea god Leviathan. Trapped in the hold, Eileen forms a forbidden bond with him. She breaks free, gets revenge and becomes a mermaid to live in the deep sea.\",\"language\":\"en_US\",\"labelList\":[{\"labelId\":\"1983832092270911490\",\"labelName\":\"Revenge\",\"labelNameUrl\":\"/drama/Revenge-1983832092270911490\",\"language\":\"en\"},{\"labelId\":\"1984208314792402946\",\"labelName\":\"Underdog Rise\",\"labelNameUrl\":\"/drama/Underdog%20Rise-1984208314792402946\",\"language\":\"en\"},{\"labelId\":\"1983832091113283586\",\"labelName\":\"Dark\",\"labelNameUrl\":\"/drama/Dark-1983832091113283586\",\"language\":\"en\"}],\"totalEpisode\":15},{\"shortPlayLibraryId\":\"2091081054531715073\",\"shortPlayId\":\"2091081121149849601\",\"shortPlayName\":\"What’s Mine Is Mine\",\"shortPlayNameNoHL\":\"What’s Mine Is Mine\",\"shortPlayNameUrl\":\"/episode/whats-mine-is-mine-2091081121149849601\",\"fullEpisodeNameUrl\":\"/full-episodes/whats-mine-is-mine-2091081121149849601\",\"shortPlayCover\":\"https://awscover.netshort.com/tos-vod-mya-v-da59d5a2040f5f77/coverG/prod/865816567_1080X1440.jpg~tplv-vod-rs:651:868.webp\",\"shotIntroduce\":\"Laila and Victor plan to leave the mafia for good. Victor once seized the godfather’s throne to protect her. But on the eve of their escape, Laila finds his secret “Lily’s Salvation Plan”: give Lily her passport and gallery, crown Laila mafia queen, then bring Lily home. Laila realizes Victor’s promised future was never hers.\",\"language\":\"en_US\",\"labelList\":[{\"labelId\":\"1983832092736479234\",\"labelName\":\"Modern Romance\",\"labelNameUrl\":\"/drama/Modern%20Romance-1983832092736479234\",\"language\":\"en\"},{\"labelId\":\"1983832092497403906\",\"labelName\":\"Mystery\",\"labelNameUrl\":\"/drama/Mystery-1983832092497403906\",\"language\":\"en\"},{\"labelId\":\"1983832091792760834\",\"labelName\":\"Plot Twist\",\"labelNameUrl\":\"/drama/Plot%20Twist-1983832091792760834\",\"language\":\"en\"}],\"totalEpisode\":31},{\"shortPlayLibraryId\":\"2091734587988103169\",\"shortPlayId\":\"2091734619365703682\",\"shortPlayName\":\"Reborn to Marry the Real Tycoon\",\"shortPlayNameNoHL\":\"Reborn to Marry the Real Tycoon\",\"shortPlayNameUrl\":\"/episode/reborn-to-marry-the-real-tycoon-2091734619365703682\",\"fullEpisodeNameUrl\":\"/full-episodes/reborn-to-marry-the-real-tycoon-2091734619365703682\",\"shortPlayCover\":\"https://awscover.netshort.com/tos-vod-mya-v-da59d5a2040f5f77/coverG/prod/840024045_3-4.jpg~tplv-vod-rs:651:868.webp\",\"shotIntroduce\":\"Reborn, Vanessa steals Clara's future CEO husband, certain she has claimed a life of luxury. Clara gladly lets the cheater go and marries Alexander, a kind mechanic. But when he is revealed as Miami's richest heir, Vanessa realizes she stole the wrong man... and lost everything.\",\"language\":\"en_US\",\"labelList\":[{\"labelId\":\"1983832092736479234\",\"labelName\":\"Modern Romance\",\"labelNameUrl\":\"/drama/Modern%20Romance-1983832092736479234\",\"language\":\"en\"},{\"labelId\":\"1983832091813732355\",\"labelName\":\"Rebirth\",\"labelNameUrl\":\"/drama/Rebirth-1983832091813732355\",\"language\":\"en\"},{\"labelId\":\"1984208314792402946\",\"labelName\":\"Underdog Rise\",\"labelNameUrl\":\"/drama/Underdog%20Rise-1984208314792402946\",\"language\":\"en\"}],\"totalEpisode\":43},{\"shortPlayLibraryId\":\"2091779921321836545\",\"shortPlayId\":\"2091780120119259138\",\"shortPlayName\":\"The Mafia Alpha’s Forbidden Mate\",\"shortPlayNameNoHL\":\"The Mafia Alpha’s Forbidden Mate\",\"shortPlayNameUrl\":\"/episode/the-mafia-alphas-forbidden-mate-2091780120119259138\",\"fullEpisodeNameUrl\":\"/full-episodes/the-mafia-alphas-forbidden-mate-2091780120119259138\",\"shortPlayCover\":\"https://awscover.netshort.com/tos-vod-mya-v-da59d5a2040f5f77/coverG/prod/859209055_1080x1440带标.png~tplv-vod-rs:651:868.webp\",\"shotIntroduce\":\"In a werewolf world where the wolf-less are oppressed, Lucas is sent as a hostage to the cruel Alpha Adrian. Adrian recognizes Lucas as his childhood savior and fiercely protects him. When Adrian faces execution to save Lucas, Lucas awakens as the strongest Red Claw heir. Together, they crush villains and unite packs to end discrimination.\",\"language\":\"en_US\",\"labelList\":[{\"labelId\":\"1984208314792402946\",\"labelName\":\"Underdog Rise\",\"labelNameUrl\":\"/drama/Underdog%20Rise-1984208314792402946\",\"language\":\"en\"},{\"labelId\":\"1983832092736479234\",\"labelName\":\"Modern Romance\",\"labelNameUrl\":\"/drama/Modern%20Romance-1983832092736479234\",\"language\":\"en\"},{\"labelId\":\"1983832092468043778\",\"labelName\":\"Fantasy\",\"labelNameUrl\":\"/drama/Fantasy-1983832092468043778\",\"language\":\"en\"}],\"totalEpisode\":52},{\"shortPlayLibraryId\":\"2092094803791536130\",\"shortPlayId\":\"2092094855331143681\",\"shortPlayName\":\"My Four Beast Mates Won’t Let Me Go\",\"shortPlayNameNoHL\":\"My Four Beast Mates Won’t Let Me Go\",\"shortPlayNameUrl\":\"/episode/my-four-beast-mates-wont-let-me-go-2092094855331143681\",\"fullEpisodeNameUrl\":\"/full-episodes/my-four-beast-mates-wont-let-me-go-2092094855331143681\",\"shortPlayCover\":\"https://awscover.netshort.com/tos-vod-mya-v-da59d5a2040f5f77/coverG/prod/941211383_3-4(4).jpg~tplv-vod-rs:651:868.webp\",\"shotIntroduce\":\"Reborn after being killed by his four contracted beast mates, cruel Prince Lorian vows to change—stop the coup, save his parents, and set them free. But the wolf, snake, lion, and deer who once hated him now refuse to let go. As they uncover a conspiracy that fractured four clans, freedom and love replace the chains of ownership.\",\"language\":\"en_US\",\"labelList\":[{\"labelId\":\"1983832036856381442\",\"labelName\":\"Fantasy\",\"labelNameUrl\":\"/drama/Fantasy-1983832036856381442\",\"language\":\"en\"},{\"labelId\":\"1983832036273373187\",\"labelName\":\"Rebirth\",\"labelNameUrl\":\"/drama/Rebirth-1983832036273373187\",\"language\":\"en\"},{\"labelId\":\"1983832036239818755\",\"labelName\":\"Underdog Rise\",\"labelNameUrl\":\"/drama/Underdog%20Rise-1983832036239818755\",\"language\":\"en\"}],\"totalEpisode\":12},{\"shortPlayLibraryId\":\"2092088646934945793\",\"shortPlayId\":\"2092088723606822913\",\"shortPlayName\":\"The False Matriarch: Judgment of the Dark Lord\",\"shortPlayNameNoHL\":\"The False Matriarch: Judgment of the Dark Lord\",\"shortPlayNameUrl\":\"/episode/the-false-matriarch-judgment-of-the-dark-lord-2092088723606822913\",\"fullEpisodeNameUrl\":\"/full-episodes/the-false-matriarch-judgment-of-the-dark-lord-2092088723606822913\",\"shortPlayCover\":\"https://awscover.netshort.com/tos-vod-mya-v-da59d5a2040f5f77/coverG/prod/940949239_3-4(3).jpg~tplv-vod-rs:651:868.webp\",\"shotIntroduce\":\"After giving birth to the heir, pureblood saint Irene hides in the sanctuary to recover. Low-rank witch Aria drugs Dark Lord Lucas with phantom incense, fakes a pregnancy, steals his supreme token and bullies Irene brutally. Lucas sees through the lie via their broken soul bond, rescues his wife, and they outwit traitor Carter at the High Table Summit. Villains are punished, Irene reforms the realm, and the couple finds redemption and peace.\",\"language\":\"en_US\",\"labelList\":[{\"labelId\":\"1983832092270911490\",\"labelName\":\"Revenge\",\"labelNameUrl\":\"/drama/Revenge-1983832092270911490\",\"language\":\"en\"},{\"labelId\":\"1983832092291883010\",\"labelName\":\"Karma Payback\",\"labelNameUrl\":\"/drama/Karma%20Payback-1983832092291883010\",\"language\":\"en\"},{\"labelId\":\"1983832091792760834\",\"labelName\":\"Plot Twist\",\"labelNameUrl\":\"/drama/Plot%20Twist-1983832091792760834\",\"language\":\"en\"}],\"totalEpisode\":19},{\"shortPlayLibraryId\":\"2092089798216867842\",\"shortPlayId\":\"2092089856136007682\",\"shortPlayName\":\"The Wife He Left to Die\",\"shortPlayNameNoHL\":\"The Wife He Left to Die\",\"shortPlayNameUrl\":\"/episode/the-wife-he-left-to-die-2092089856136007682\",\"fullEpisodeNameUrl\":\"/full-episodes/the-wife-he-left-to-die-2092089856136007682\",\"shortPlayCover\":\"https://awscover.netshort.com/tos-vod-mya-v-da59d5a2040f5f77/coverG/prod/940830715_3-4(2).jpg~tplv-vod-rs:651:868.webp\",\"shotIntroduce\":\"Betrayed five years, terminal cancer patient Enone fakes her death and uses her last days for revenge. She saved blinded husband Damon with a pendant, but first love Opal stole credit and bought up her cancer drug. When truth surfaces, Damon learns Enone was his savior—too late. Enone dies free; Damon faces prison and lifelong remorse.\",\"language\":\"en_US\",\"labelList\":[{\"labelId\":\"1983832092270911490\",\"labelName\":\"Revenge\",\"labelNameUrl\":\"/drama/Revenge-1983832092270911490\",\"language\":\"en\"},{\"labelId\":\"1983832092291883010\",\"labelName\":\"Karma Payback\",\"labelNameUrl\":\"/drama/Karma%20Payback-1983832092291883010\",\"language\":\"en\"},{\"labelId\":\"1983832092115722243\",\"labelName\":\"All-Too-Late\",\"labelNameUrl\":\"/drama/All-Too-Late-1983832092115722243\",\"language\":\"en\"}],\"totalEpisode\":16},{\"shortPlayLibraryId\":\"2092094098817114114\",\"shortPlayId\":\"2092094132195385345\",\"shortPlayName\":\"The Green Witch Stops Pretending\",\"shortPlayNameNoHL\":\"The Green Witch Stops Pretending\",\"shortPlayNameUrl\":\"/episode/the-green-witch-stops-pretending-2092094132195385345\",\"fullEpisodeNameUrl\":\"/full-episodes/the-green-witch-stops-pretending-2092094132195385345\",\"shortPlayCover\":\"https://awscover.netshort.com/tos-vod-mya-v-da59d5a2040f5f77/coverG/prod/940572559_3-4(1).jpg~tplv-vod-rs:651:868.webp\",\"shotIntroduce\":\"After seven years of sacrificing her own power to protect her husband and son, Jocelyn is treated as a useless Green Witch. When her husband repeatedly favors another woman and their son rejects her, Jocelyn finally breaks their blood-bound marriage pact and walks away. But no one knows she is Vein, the legendary Chief Vein Guardian who has protected the entire continent for seven years.\",\"language\":\"en_US\",\"labelList\":[{\"labelId\":\"1984208314792402946\",\"labelName\":\"Underdog Rise\",\"labelNameUrl\":\"/drama/Underdog%20Rise-1984208314792402946\",\"language\":\"en\"},{\"labelId\":\"1983832092291883010\",\"labelName\":\"Karma Payback\",\"labelNameUrl\":\"/drama/Karma%20Payback-1983832092291883010\",\"language\":\"en\"},{\"labelId\":\"1983832092082167810\",\"labelName\":\"Multiple Identities\",\"labelNameUrl\":\"/drama/Multiple%20Identities-1983832092082167810\",\"language\":\"en\"}],\"totalEpisode\":14},{\"shortPlayLibraryId\":\"2091830474865332225\",\"shortPlayId\":\"2091830503483072513\",\"shortPlayName\":\"Elite Grandma's Wrath,Empire's Collapse\",\"shortPlayNameNoHL\":\"Elite Grandma's Wrath,Empire's Collapse\",\"shortPlayNameUrl\":\"/episode/elite-grandmas-wrathempires-collapse-2091830503483072513\",\"fullEpisodeNameUrl\":\"/full-episodes/elite-grandmas-wrathempires-collapse-2091830503483072513\",\"shortPlayCover\":\"https://awscover.netshort.com/tos-vod-mya-v-da59d5a2040f5f77/coverG/prod/942274491_LA001236-P英语.jpg~tplv-vod-rs:651:868.webp\",\"shotIntroduce\":\"Supreme Deity Nova lived as a slave for 30 years for her son, only to face acid torture and electric shocks from his greedy family! Heartbroken, she reclaims her ultimate power, instantly crushing their empire. She exposes their brutal crimes, leaving the parasites to rot in the wasteland!\",\"language\":\"en_US\",\"labelList\":[{\"labelId\":\"1983832175541043202\",\"labelName\":\"Sci-Fi\",\"labelNameUrl\":\"/drama/Sci-Fi-1983832175541043202\",\"language\":\"en\"},{\"labelId\":\"1983832176153411587\",\"labelName\":\"Revenge\",\"labelNameUrl\":\"/drama/Revenge-1983832176153411587\",\"language\":\"en\"},{\"labelId\":\"1983832175893364739\",\"labelName\":\"Karma Payback\",\"labelNameUrl\":\"/drama/Karma%20Payback-1983832175893364739\",\"language\":\"en\"}],\"totalEpisode\":16},{\"shortPlayLibraryId\":\"2092081289106513922\",\"shortPlayId\":\"2092081348594327553\",\"shortPlayName\":\"My Maid Claims My House\",\"shortPlayNameNoHL\":\"My Maid Claims My House\",\"shortPlayNameUrl\":\"/episode/my-maid-claims-my-house-2092081348594327553\",\"fullEpisodeNameUrl\":\"/full-episodes/my-maid-claims-my-house-2092081348594327553\",\"shortPlayCover\":\"https://awscover.netshort.com/tos-vod-mya-v-da59d5a2040f5f77/coverG/prod/939226623_3：4海报.png~tplv-vod-rs:651:868.webp\",\"shotIntroduce\":\"Sophia, the true heiress of the Davis family, discovers that her maid Stella and Stella’s daughter Chloe have taken over her mansion and treated her like an outsider. After enduring betrayal and humiliation, Sophia reveals her real identity as the president of Davis Group and makes them pay for destroying her family.\",\"language\":\"en_US\",\"labelList\":[{\"labelId\":\"1983832092736479234\",\"labelName\":\"Modern Romance\",\"labelNameUrl\":\"/drama/Modern%20Romance-1983832092736479234\",\"language\":\"en\"},{\"labelId\":\"1983832091792760834\",\"labelName\":\"Plot Twist\",\"labelNameUrl\":\"/drama/Plot%20Twist-1983832091792760834\",\"language\":\"en\"},{\"labelId\":\"1983832092270911490\",\"labelName\":\"Revenge\",\"labelNameUrl\":\"/drama/Revenge-1983832092270911490\",\"language\":\"en\"}],\"totalEpisode\":16},{\"shortPlayLibraryId\":\"2091829319657545729\",\"shortPlayId\":\"2091829362980511746\",\"shortPlayName\":\"The Phoenix Queen: Rising from the Flames\",\"shortPlayNameNoHL\":\"The Phoenix Queen: Rising from the Flames\",\"shortPlayNameUrl\":\"/episode/the-phoenix-queen-rising-from-the-flames-2091829362980511746\",\"fullEpisodeNameUrl\":\"/full-episodes/the-phoenix-queen-rising-from-the-flames-2091829362980511746\",\"shortPlayCover\":\"https://awscover.netshort.com/tos-vod-mya-v-da59d5a2040f5f77/coverG/prod/943189902_LA001443-P英语.jpg~tplv-vod-rs:651:868.webp\",\"shotIntroduce\":\"Dragon Knight Fina gave her dragon scale to save Prince Damian, only to be abused while a fraud stole credit. She died in battle, yet he wed another. Learning the truth, Damian gouged his heart to revive her, in vain. Reborn as Phoenix Princess Elysia, Fina returns in flame，\\\"Forgiveness? Never. Strip your crown and serve as my guard for life!\\\"\",\"language\":\"en_US\",\"labelList\":[{\"labelId\":\"1983832091813732355\",\"labelName\":\"Rebirth\",\"labelNameUrl\":\"/drama/Rebirth-1983832091813732355\",\"language\":\"en\"},{\"labelId\":\"1983832091075534850\",\"labelName\":\"Tragic Love\",\"labelNameUrl\":\"/drama/Tragic%20Love-1983832091075534850\",\"language\":\"en\"},{\"labelId\":\"1983832090798710787\",\"labelName\":\"Ancient Times\",\"labelNameUrl\":\"/drama/Ancient%20Times-1983832090798710787\",\"language\":\"en\"}],\"totalEpisode\":20},{\"shortPlayLibraryId\":\"2091079598529413121\",\"shortPlayId\":\"2091079652631740418\",\"shortPlayName\":\"The Replacement\",\"shortPlayNameNoHL\":\"The Replacement\",\"shortPlayNameUrl\":\"/episode/the-replacement-2091079652631740418\",\"fullEpisodeNameUrl\":\"/full-episodes/the-replacement-2091079652631740418\",\"shortPlayCover\":\"https://awscover.netshort.com/tos-vod-mya-v-da59d5a2040f5f77/coverG/prod/942419527_LA001315-P英语.jpg~tplv-vod-rs:651:868.webp\",\"shotIntroduce\":\"Surgeon Eleanor infiltrates Leo’s medical empire to avenge her grandmother, whose identity was stolen 50 years ago. Rejecting Leo’s granddaughter, she exposes decades of fraud. With Leo jailed, Eleanor returns to Beacon Hill to open a clinic in her grandmother's name, reclaiming justice denied for three generations.\",\"language\":\"en_US\",\"labelList\":[{\"labelId\":\"1983832092270911490\",\"labelName\":\"Revenge\",\"labelNameUrl\":\"/drama/Revenge-1983832092270911490\",\"language\":\"en\"},{\"labelId\":\"1983832091901812738\",\"labelName\":\"Karma\",\"labelNameUrl\":\"/drama/Karma-1983832091901812738\",\"language\":\"en\"},{\"labelId\":\"1983832090844848130\",\"labelName\":\"Modern\",\"labelNameUrl\":\"/drama/Modern-1983832090844848130\",\"language\":\"en\"}],\"totalEpisode\":17},{\"shortPlayLibraryId\":\"2092082833524740097\",\"shortPlayId\":\"2092082895143264257\",\"shortPlayName\":\"Border: The Return of the Warmaster\",\"shortPlayNameNoHL\":\"Border: The Return of the Warmaster\",\"shortPlayNameUrl\":\"/episode/border-the-return-of-the-warmaster-2092082895143264257\",\"fullEpisodeNameUrl\":\"/full-episodes/border-the-return-of-the-warmaster-2092082895143264257\",\"shortPlayCover\":\"https://awscover.netshort.com/tos-vod-mya-v-da59d5a2040f5f77/coverG/prod/944357246_LA001641-P英语.jpg~tplv-vod-rs:651:868.webp\",\"shotIntroduce\":\"After ten years overseas, decorated war hero Jack Reno returns to Blackstone Town, only to find his mother and sister terrorized by local thugs. He uncovers a web linking corrupt police, the Blackstone Consortium, and the Syndicate—and unleashes his elite authority to crush them, until a brutal strike on his family turns the war personal.\",\"language\":\"en_US\",\"labelList\":[{\"labelId\":\"1983832036302733315\",\"labelName\":\"Revenge\",\"labelNameUrl\":\"/drama/Revenge-1983832036302733315\",\"language\":\"en\"},{\"labelId\":\"1983832036889935874\",\"labelName\":\"Urban Life\",\"labelNameUrl\":\"/drama/Urban%20Life-1983832036889935874\",\"language\":\"en\"},{\"labelId\":\"1983832036441145346\",\"labelName\":\"Hype\",\"labelNameUrl\":\"/drama/Hype-1983832036441145346\",\"language\":\"en\"}],\"totalEpisode\":15},{\"shortPlayLibraryId\":\"2092081515624091649\",\"shortPlayId\":\"2092081573790699522\",\"shortPlayName\":\"Return With The Heir\",\"shortPlayNameNoHL\":\"Return With The Heir\",\"shortPlayNameUrl\":\"/episode/return-with-the-heir-2092081573790699522\",\"fullEpisodeNameUrl\":\"/full-episodes/return-with-the-heir-2092081573790699522\",\"shortPlayCover\":\"https://awscover.netshort.com/tos-vod-mya-v-da59d5a2040f5f77/coverG/prod/944200175_LA001497-P英语.png~tplv-vod-rs:651:868.webp\",\"shotIntroduce\":\"Six years ago, Samantha saved injured Alpha King William and gave birth to their child after he left. Betrayed by her family, she became vampire Jason’s servant and endured years of suffering. When William discovers a blood diamond carrying his family’s scent, he finally finds Samantha and their child.\",\"language\":\"en_US\",\"labelList\":[{\"labelId\":\"1983832091075534850\",\"labelName\":\"Tragic Love\",\"labelNameUrl\":\"/drama/Tragic%20Love-1983832091075534850\",\"language\":\"en\"},{\"labelId\":\"1983832092468043778\",\"labelName\":\"Fantasy\",\"labelNameUrl\":\"/drama/Fantasy-1983832092468043778\",\"language\":\"en\"},{\"labelId\":\"1983832091960532994\",\"labelName\":\"Runaway Pregnancy\",\"labelNameUrl\":\"/drama/Runaway%20Pregnancy-1983832091960532994\",\"language\":\"en\"}],\"totalEpisode\":20},{\"shortPlayLibraryId\":\"2092082333425291265\",\"shortPlayId\":\"2092082395081560066\",\"shortPlayName\":\"The Cursed Dragon King's Lost Queen\",\"shortPlayNameNoHL\":\"The Cursed Dragon King's Lost Queen\",\"shortPlayNameUrl\":\"/episode/the-cursed-dragon-kings-lost-queen-2092082395081560066\",\"fullEpisodeNameUrl\":\"/full-episodes/the-cursed-dragon-kings-lost-queen-2092082395081560066\",\"shortPlayCover\":\"https://awscover.netshort.com/tos-vod-mya-v-da59d5a2040f5f77/coverG/prod/944242679_LA001622-P英语.png~tplv-vod-rs:651:868.webp\",\"shotIntroduce\":\"Elara with ancient‑dragon blood is framed by her step‑father. She lifts Lord Kael’s dragon‑fire curse after one‑night encounter. She flees, gives birth and has her son abducted. Working as a wet‑nurse in the castle, she reunites with Kael, awakens her bloodline, finds her son and marries him.\",\"language\":\"en_US\",\"labelList\":[{\"labelId\":\"1983832092468043778\",\"labelName\":\"Fantasy\",\"labelNameUrl\":\"/drama/Fantasy-1983832092468043778\",\"language\":\"en\"},{\"labelId\":\"1983832092270911490\",\"labelName\":\"Revenge\",\"labelNameUrl\":\"/drama/Revenge-1983832092270911490\",\"language\":\"en\"},{\"labelId\":\"1984208314792402946\",\"labelName\":\"Underdog Rise\",\"labelNameUrl\":\"/drama/Underdog%20Rise-1984208314792402946\",\"language\":\"en\"}],\"totalEpisode\":15},{\"shortPlayLibraryId\":\"2092081068263825410\",\"shortPlayId\":\"2092081124186480643\",\"shortPlayName\":\"One Night, Fled with Billionaire's Baby\",\"shortPlayNameNoHL\":\"One Night, Fled with Billionaire's Baby\",\"shortPlayNameUrl\":\"/episode/one-night-fled-with-billionaires-baby-2092081124186480643\",\"fullEpisodeNameUrl\":\"/full-episodes/one-night-fled-with-billionaires-baby-2092081124186480643\",\"shortPlayCover\":\"https://awscover.netshort.com/tos-vod-mya-v-da59d5a2040f5f77/coverG/prod/943718399_LA001481-P英语.png~tplv-vod-rs:651:868.webp\",\"shotIntroduce\":\"Seven years ago, Irene spent a night with billionaire Dorian by mistake and birthed twins. One son was stolen and raised by Dorian, while the other stayed with her. Years later, Irene returns as a top doctor to find her lost son. As the twin boys secretly swap identities to matchmake their parents, Irene avenges her mother and wins love.\",\"language\":\"en_US\",\"labelList\":[{\"labelId\":\"1983832091792760834\",\"labelName\":\"Plot Twist\",\"labelNameUrl\":\"/drama/Plot%20Twist-1983832091792760834\",\"language\":\"en\"},{\"labelId\":\"1983832092736479234\",\"labelName\":\"Modern Romance\",\"labelNameUrl\":\"/drama/Modern%20Romance-1983832092736479234\",\"language\":\"en\"},{\"labelId\":\"1983832092270911490\",\"labelName\":\"Revenge\",\"labelNameUrl\":\"/drama/Revenge-1983832092270911490\",\"language\":\"en\"}],\"totalEpisode\":15},{\"shortPlayLibraryId\":\"2091822590148431873\",\"shortPlayId\":\"2091822632808697858\",\"shortPlayName\":\"Who hurt her\",\"shortPlayNameNoHL\":\"Who hurt her\",\"shortPlayNameUrl\":\"/episode/who-hurt-her-2091822632808697858\",\"fullEpisodeNameUrl\":\"/full-episodes/who-hurt-her-2091822632808697858\",\"shortPlayCover\":\"https://awscover.netshort.com/tos-vod-mya-v-da59d5a2040f5f77/coverG/prod/942919199_LA001357-P英语(1).png~tplv-vod-rs:651:868.webp\",\"shotIntroduce\":\"Serena Thorne hides her identity as an underground-empire heiress to marry Ethan Walker. In labor, she discovers his affair and is nearly killed in his hospital. After activating her family's deadly SOS, Serena returns as a Thorne, using legal and corporate warfare to strip Ethan and the Walker empire of everything.\",\"language\":\"en_US\",\"labelList\":[{\"labelId\":\"1983832092270911490\",\"labelName\":\"Revenge\",\"labelNameUrl\":\"/drama/Revenge-1983832092270911490\",\"language\":\"en\"},{\"labelId\":\"1984208314792402946\",\"labelName\":\"Underdog Rise\",\"labelNameUrl\":\"/drama/Underdog%20Rise-1984208314792402946\",\"language\":\"en\"},{\"labelId\":\"1983832091075534850\",\"labelName\":\"Tragic Love\",\"labelNameUrl\":\"/drama/Tragic%20Love-1983832091075534850\",\"language\":\"en\"}],\"totalEpisode\":19},{\"shortPlayLibraryId\":\"2092166368742866945\",\"shortPlayId\":\"2092166567783563265\",\"shortPlayName\":\"My Baby Says Daddy Rules the Sky\",\"shortPlayNameNoHL\":\"My Baby Says Daddy Rules the Sky\",\"shortPlayNameUrl\":\"/episode/my-baby-says-daddy-rules-the-sky-2092166567783563265\",\"fullEpisodeNameUrl\":\"/full-episodes/my-baby-says-daddy-rules-the-sky-2092166567783563265\",\"shortPlayCover\":\"https://awscover.netshort.com/tos-vod-mya-v-da59d5a2040f5f77/coverG/prod/942382686_3-4(11).jpg~tplv-vod-rs:651:868.webp\",\"shotIntroduce\":\"Radiation wasteland: natural birth is dead. Faye conceives after a one-night stand. Mara steals her dome pass and traps her in a black clinic for abortion. Her six-week fetus, reincarnated, speaks and guides her to a comm chip. Signal reaches Kaelen, dome commander, who leads a fleet. A gene corp hunts the fetus. Can they rise from dust to clouds?\",\"language\":\"en_US\",\"labelList\":[{\"labelId\":\"1984209208347541505\",\"labelName\":\"One Night Stand\",\"labelNameUrl\":\"/drama/One%20Night%20Stand-1984209208347541505\",\"language\":\"en\"},{\"labelId\":\"1983832092291883010\",\"labelName\":\"Karma Payback\",\"labelNameUrl\":\"/drama/Karma%20Payback-1983832092291883010\",\"language\":\"en\"},{\"labelId\":\"1984208314792402946\",\"labelName\":\"Underdog Rise\",\"labelNameUrl\":\"/drama/Underdog%20Rise-1984208314792402946\",\"language\":\"en\"}],\"totalEpisode\":14},{\"shortPlayLibraryId\":\"2091392566274412545\",\"shortPlayId\":\"2091392594892148738\",\"shortPlayName\":\"The Economy Class Husband Strikes Back\",\"shortPlayNameNoHL\":\"The Economy Class Husband Strikes Back\",\"shortPlayNameUrl\":\"/episode/the-economy-class-husband-strikes-back-2091392594892148738\",\"fullEpisodeNameUrl\":\"/full-episodes/the-economy-class-husband-strikes-back-2091392594892148738\",\"shortPlayCover\":\"https://awscover.netshort.com/tos-vod-mya-v-da59d5a2040f5f77/coverG/prod/947068822_output.lin(8).jpg~tplv-vod-rs:651:868.webp\",\"shotIntroduce\":\"Glenn, airline chairman, secretly helps his wife become an airport GM. She cheats with a flight attendant. He boards his own plane with his disabled mother-in-law to surprise her. Jenny and her lover are on the same flight. Can the man who built her career survive the nightmare at thirty thousand feet?\",\"language\":\"en_US\",\"labelList\":[{\"labelId\":\"1983832036889935874\",\"labelName\":\"Urban Life\",\"labelNameUrl\":\"/drama/Urban%20Life-1983832036889935874\",\"language\":\"en\"},{\"labelId\":\"1983832036294344705\",\"labelName\":\"Karma Payback\",\"labelNameUrl\":\"/drama/Karma%20Payback-1983832036294344705\",\"language\":\"en\"},{\"labelId\":\"1983832036390813699\",\"labelName\":\"Feel-Good\",\"labelNameUrl\":\"/drama/Feel-Good-1983832036390813699\",\"language\":\"en\"}],\"totalEpisode\":50}]}]\n"])</script></body></html>